<h2>6. Communications and personal data</h2><p>Use approved contact channels and retain only data required for the stated purpose. Delivery, terms acceptance and signature have their own evidence. The source references below identify this specimen’s proposed terms; they do not establish accepted terms or actual onboarding.</p><h2>7. Review and execution</h2><p>Terms: ${facts.termsReference}. Complaints reference: ${facts.complaintsReference}. This specimen is visibly unsigned. A deployed journey must bind the authorized parties and their consent to the exact retained content version and digest before recording execution.</p><div class="signature-grid"><div><strong>Customer signature</strong><p>Unsigned — sandbox specimen</p><p>Date: ____________________</p></div><div><strong>Authorized institution representative</strong><p>Unsigned — sandbox specimen</p><p>Date: ____________________</p></div></div><h2>Referenced records</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Snapshot</th><th scope="col">Version</th></tr></thead><tbody><#list facts.sources as row><tr><td>${row.resourceReference}</td><td>${row.version}</td></tr></#list></tbody></table>

